## 1. Purpose & Overview

ATOMS OS is an independent operating system project built from bare metal, encompassing the BOS Kernel, native BOFS filesystem, system services, hardware drivers, graphics and compositing infrastructure, and userland runtimes.

This License is designed to:
* Grant broad, permissive freedoms to developers, organizations, businesses, and researchers to study, compile, run, modify, fork, distribute, and commercially exploit the software, including selling hardware or products containing ATOMS OS;
* Vigorously protect the original authorship, provenance, identity, and integrity of ATOMS OS, the BOS Kernel, and the BOFS filesystem;
* Prevent downstream distributors or third parties from falsely claiming original authorship or misleading the public regarding the origin or official status of modified versions;
* Fully preserve and respect the independent licenses of all third-party software components included in or referenced by the repository.

---

