* **"Third-Party Software"** means any software, library, driver, codec, font, specification, or utility included in, bundled with, or referenced by the repository that is authored by a third party and governed by an independent open-source or public license (including, without limitation, MIT, BSD 2-Clause, BSD 3-Clause, Apache 2.0, Apache 2.0 with LLVM Exception, CC0 1.0 Universal, SIL Open Font License 1.1, GNU LGPL v2.1+, and GNU GPL v2).
