* **"Derivative Work"** means any work based upon the Original Code, or upon any pre-existing work, such as a revision, modification, translation, condensation, expansion, or any other form in which the Original Code may be recast, transformed, or adapted.
* **"Commercial Use"** means any use, deployment, reproduction, distribution, or integration of the software in connection with a revenue-generating activity, commercial product, commercial distribution, subscription service, hardware device, or enterprise offering.
* **"You"** (or **"Your"**) means an individual or legal entity exercising permissions granted by this License.

